# Phase 4 flagged build lane: storage-v2.
#
# This file is loaded ONLY by Vite's `--mode storage-v2` build, which is what
# `npm run build:storage-v2-flagged` and `npm run test:e2e:storage` use. It is
# not loaded by `npm run build:web`, so the production default stays
# `VITE_STORAGE_REPOSITORY=legacy` (plan section 11) and the rollback for the
# whole cutover remains a plain production rebuild.
#
# Purpose: a real legacy migration, a real IndexedDB transaction, and a real
# device-local attachment cannot be observed on the default build, because the
# default build never opens storage-v2 at all. Deleting this file and the two
# scripts that use it fully removes the lane.
VITE_STORAGE_REPOSITORY=v2
